  title: Hindustan Socialist Republican Association
  text: Founded in 1924 as the Hindustan Republican Association, it carried out the Kakori train action in 1925. Renamed the Hindustan Socialist Republican Association in 1928, under Chandrashekhar Azad and Bhagat Singh, it adopted socialist aims.
